OL,3,AMPs to vote on legalising assisted
OL,4,Adying in England and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe legalisation of assisted dying in
OL,7,FEngland and Wales could move a step
OL,8,Fcloser on Friday when MPs vote on a
OL,9,Fproposal to introduce it.
OL,11,FThe bill would allow adults with fewer
OL,12,Fthan six months to live to apply to be
OL,13,Fgiven help to end their own life,
OL,14,Fsubject to certain safeguards.
OL,16,FLabour MP Lauren Edwards, the bill's
OL,17,Fsponsor, said there was a "real human
OL,18,Fcost to the delay" in passing the
OL,19,Flegislation - but opponents say it
OL,20,Flacks sufficient safeguards,
OL,21,Fparticularly for vulnerable people.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
