OL,3,AEsther Rantzen says she is too fragile
OL,4,Ato travel to Switzerland to end life
OL,5,
OL,6,FDame Esther Rantzen has said she is now
OL,7,F"too physically fragile" to travel to
OL,8,FSwitzerland to end her life at an
OL,9,Fassisted suicide clinic.
OL,11,FThe veteran broadcaster, 86, said she
OL,12,Fwould have to fly to the country, where
OL,13,Fthe practice is legal, alone, which she
OL,14,Fcould only have done before her life
OL,15,Fbecame "unbearable" and before she was
OL,16,Fready to end her life.
OL,18,FThe Childline founder, who is
OL,19,Fterminally ill with cancer, first
OL,20,Frevealed in December 2023 that she had
OL,21,Fjoined the Dignitas clinic.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
