OL,4,Aup for auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FAuction house Sotheby's expects the
OL,7,Fdress to sell for up to $300,000
OL,8,F(#220,000) when it goes under the
OL,9,Fhammer on 9 December.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
